<title>UK: BNG sets $250 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $250 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    07.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0095  PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.822    SPREAD	+ONE BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETH	HOME CTRY  NETH	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER THE DEPT PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
